Algorithm

1. Store applicant data in a nested list.

2. Check aggregate, both subject marks, attendance, and income for every applicant.

3. Record eligible applicants as tuples; record failed applicants with a reason.

4. Sort the eligible tuples using the published ranking order.

5. Print rank, award status, and rejected applicants.

Flowchart

START -> Read applicants

  -> Check all minimum and maximum rules

     -> Fail? YES: Record reason -> next applicant

     -> Fail? NO: Add to eligible list -> next applicant

  -> Sort eligible by tie-break rules

  -> Rank and award first two

  -> Print results -> END

